        <p>OUR FOUR SPECIAL SHILLING BOXES, Worth 2s. 6d. to 3s. each. The "COMP'PON ANNUAL BOX" contains 18 beautifully designed Ribboned Leaflet Cards, all different, together with Envelopes ; worth at least 2s. Gcl. ONE SHILLING the Box; postage 2id. The " VALUE BOX" contains 30 Dainty Folding Cards, in various designs. with Enve- lopes—alvery Cheap Collection. One Shilling the Box; restage 21d. The "XMAS BOX 'Y contains 12 high-class Autograph Cards, nearly every card different, and Envelopes. These boxes vary, but in each case the cards are worth from 2s. 6d. to 35.; One Shilling the Box ; postage 2d. The "MAYFAIR BOX" contains 12 beautiful Autograph Cards, all folding, in black and white, parchment, etc., all different, with Envelopes-,-One Shilling the Box: postage 2d. A SPECIAL PURCHASE of Messrs. C. W. Faulkner's High-class Autograph Boxes, to be offered at about One-Third usual prices. They comprise about 4,000 Boxes, 2id. to 2s. (Id. each. No. 9.-300 Sit:penny Boxes, Containing Six Autograph Folding Cards and Envelopes, violet and rose designs—the entire collection at 23d. per box. No. 7. and No. 3.-950 Sixpenny Boxes, con- taining six Children's Autograph Cards and Envelopes, pretty figure designs, all folding cards—tho entire collection at 21d. per box. No. 1.-400 Sixpenny Boxes, containing six Autograph Folding Cards— bluebell and daisy designs, with linvelopes—the entire collection at 2N. per box. No. 8.-100 Sixpenny Boxes, containing six Autograph Cards, Dutch children design, all folding cards, with envelopes—the entire collection at 3!,d. per box. Two Varieties, Nos. IG and 22.-500 Shilling Boxes, containing six claoice Folding Cards, various designs, with Envelopes—th 2 entire collection at 41d. per box. No 26.-500 Is, (Id. Boxes, containing six beau- tiful Leaflet Cards, floral designs on cover, picture leaflets, several varieties in a box, with Envelopes—the entire collection at Gld.</p>
        <p>per box. :No. 27.-100 Two Shilling Boxes, containing nine beautiful Aatograph Cards, several different designs, folding ribboned leaflet cards, in black and white, parchment, etc., with Envelopes—the entire collection. at Bd.</p>
        <p>per box. 'Nos. 34 and 35.-300 Three-shilling Boxes, two varieties, containing ten and twelve ribboned leaflet cards, various floral designs, with picture leaflets, and with Envelopes—the entire collection at Is. 4d. per box; post- age 3d. *No. 40.-50 Five-shilling Boxes, containing 20 high-class Autograph Cards, various de- signs, ribboned leaflet cards, with Envelopes —all to be sold at 2s. Gd. per box, postage 4d. No. 41.—G0 Eight-shilling Boxes, containing 20 high-class Autograph Cards, a variety of de- signs, in black and whito.paxchment,ribboned, and leaflet cards—all to be sold at 3s. Gd. per box ; postage Id. _.A Magnaficent Assortment of High-class Auto- graph cards in boxes, complete with Enve- lopes, the box-514., 101 d., Md., Is. 411, and 2s. Gd.</p>
