      <div type="article" xml:id="PressMint-GB_1905-12-09_WidnesExaminer_art0122" n="art0122">
        <head>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR</head>
        <p>LETTERS TO THE EDITOR</p>
        <p>NOTICE TO CORRESPONDENTS. Authors of letters intended for publication must in all cases send their namps and addresses to the Editor as a guarantee of good faith. CORRESPONDENTS are particularly requested to send letters intended for Friday's " Examiner " not later than Thursday morning. A. RATIIRONE.—Letter received too late for insertion in this weeks's issue.—ED. "E."</p>
