he same time. What a picture cif scant Mayoral dignity and an LARGIt SFIRET ALMANACS example of the worst form of applying the (ROW PUBLISHED ON FRIDAS AP tiNOON) closure to a debate is here presented The towu will, we are sure, resent Alderman OF PENNY. Bolton's serious lapse from duty and decorum. If the resolution was out of order, the proposer should have been informed before it was printed on the agenda. For busioesa to be brought for- ward and disposed of in this cavalier fashion is an insnit to the intelligence and honesty of. purpose of the Council. Moreover, an explanation was due in respect of the point of order whish was raised, and the Mayor should, at least, have so far bowed to the dictates of duty ar.d the call of common courtesy as to give the Council some reason for his arbitrary ruling. We regret very much that he so far forgot himself as to very seriously lower the dignity of his office and make the authority of which he is the eleeted head, the laughing-stock of the district.</p>
